Third-party assets

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository. The assets below were not made here. Both are released under CC0 1.0, which asks for no attribution; it is given anyway.

- Building Kit by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/building-kit), CC0 1.0. The bundled demo house (public/demo/house.glb) is assembled from its pieces. The source pieces and the licence text are in assets-src/kenney-building-kit/ and public/demo/LICENSE-kenney.txt.
- Textures from Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com), CC0 1.0. The demo scene uses the 1k diffuse maps of red_brick_03, wood_floor_deck, white_plaster_02, beige_wall_001, floor_tiles_06 and concrete_wall_008, listed in e2e/showcase/demo/CREDITS.md.
